識弘遠，忠亮雅正，行為世表，歷位內外，勳庸彌著。乃者約峻狂狡，毒流朝廷，社稷之危，賴公以寧。功侔古烈，勳邁桓文。方倚大猷，藩翼時難，昊天不弔，奄忽薨殂，朕用震悼于厥心。夫爵以顯德，諡以表行，所以崇明軌迹，丕揚徽劭。今贈太宰，諡曰文成，祠以太牢。魂而有靈，嘉茲寵榮。」","raw_start":8645,"raw_end":9188,"raw_line":84},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian","book_id":"b-jinshu-067","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-067-xijian"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line086","text":"初，鑒值永嘉喪亂，在鄉里甚窮餒，鄉人以鑒名德，傳共飴之。時兄子邁、外甥周翼並小，常攜之就食。鄉人曰：「各自饑困，以君賢，欲共相濟耳，恐不能兼有所存。」鑒於是獨往，食訖，以飯著兩頰邊，還吐與二兒，後並得存，同過江。邁位至護軍，翼為剡縣令。鑒之薨也，翼追撫育之恩，解職而歸，席苫心喪三年。二子：愔、曇。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line086:m0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"鑒","kind":"person","person_id":"6lr_zci_i0j","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line086:m0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"鑒","kind":"person","person_id":"6lr_zci_i0j","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line086:m0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"邁","kind":"person","person_id":"dvr_kha_fi6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line086:m0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"周翼","kind":"person","person_id":"h15_bxq_n5u_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line086:m0075","start":75,"end":76,"surface":"鑒","kind":"person","person_id":"6lr_zci_i0j","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line086:m0106","start":106,"end":107,"surface":"邁","kind":"person","person_id":"dvr_kha_fi6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line086:m0112","start":112,"end":113,"surface":"翼","kind":"person","person_id":"h15_bxq_n5u_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line086:m0118","start":118,"end":119,"surface":"鑒","kind":"person","person_id":"6lr_zci_i0j","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line086:m0123","start":123,"end":124,"surface":"翼","kind":"person","person_id":"h15_bxq_n5u_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line086:m0145","start":145,"end":146,"surface":"愔","kind":"person","person_id":"ier_lqj_x4q","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian:line086:m0147","start":147,"end":148,"surface":"曇","kind":"person","person_id":"e5k_f2i_cog","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":86,"last_line":86,"revision_id":2592755},"source_quote":{"witness":"j67","quote":"初，鑒值永嘉喪亂，在鄉里甚窮餒，鄉人以鑒名德，傳共飴之。時兄子邁、外甥周翼並小，常攜之就食。鄉人曰：「各自饑困，以君賢，欲共相濟耳，恐不能兼有所存。」鑒於是獨往，食訖，以飯著兩頰邊，還吐與二兒，後並得存，同過江。邁位至護軍，翼為剡縣令。鑒之薨也，翼追撫育之恩，解職而歸，席苫心喪三年。二子：愔、曇。","raw_start":9190,"raw_end":9339,"raw_line":86},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian","book_id":"b-jinshu-067","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-067-xijian"},{"id":"c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin067-xijian:food","text":"郗公値永嘉喪亂，在鄕里甚窮餒，鄕人以公名德，傳共飴之。公常攜兄子邁及外生周翼二小兒往食。鄕人曰：「各自饑困，以君之賢，欲共濟君耳；恐不能兼有所存。」公於是獨往食，輒含飯著兩頰邊，還吐與二兒。後並得存，同過江。","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin067-xijian:food:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"郗公","kind":"person","person_id":"6lr_zci_i0j","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin067-xijian:food:m0032","start":32,"end":33,"surface":"邁","kind":"person","person_id":"dvr_kha_fi6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin067-xijian:food:m0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"周翼","kind":"person","person_id":"h15_bxq_n5u_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","source_quote":{"witness":"de","quote":"{{ProperNoun|郗公}}値{{ProperNoun|永嘉}}喪亂，在鄕-{里}-甚窮餒，鄕人以公名德，傳共飴之。公常攜兄子{{ProperNoun|邁}}及外生{{ProperNoun|周翼}}二小兒往食。鄕人曰：「各自-{饑}-困，以君之賢，欲共濟君耳；恐不能兼有所存。」公-{於}-是獨往食，輒含飯著兩頰邊，還吐與二兒。-{後}--{並}-得存，同過{{ProperNoun|江}}。","raw_start":12524,"raw_end":12723,"raw_line":26},"chapter_id":"c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin067-xijian","book_id":"b-shishuoxinyu-001","work_id":"w-shishuoxinyu","source_id":"s-shishuoxinyu-001-jin067-xijian"},{"id":"c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin067-xijian:nephew","text":"鑒兄子邁，字思遠，有幹世才略。累遷少府、中護軍。","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin067-xijian:nephew:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"鑒","kind":"person","person_id":"6lr_zci_i0j","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin067-xijian:nephew:m0003","start":3,"end":4,"surface":"邁","kind":"person","person_id":"dvr_kha_fi6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin067-xijian:nephew:m0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"思遠","kind":"person","person_id":"dvr_kha_fi6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"text_layer":"witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note","source_quote":{"witness":"de","quote":"{{ProperNoun|-{鑒}-}}兄子{{ProperNoun|邁}}，字{{ProperNoun|思遠}}，有-{幹}-世-{才}-略。累遷少府、中護軍。","raw_start":12986,"raw_end":13067,"raw_line":26,"source_layer":"劉注引中興書"},"attribution":{"annotator":"劉孝標","quoted_work":"中興書"},"chapter_id":"c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin067-xijian","book_id":"b-shishuoxinyu-001","work_id":"w-shishuoxinyu","source_id":"s-shishuoxinyu-001-jin067-xijian"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-067-xijian","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-067","source_id":"s-jinshu-067-xijian","source":{"title":"晉書卷六十七","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2592755","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2592755","revision_id":2592755,"accessed_on":"2026-11-21","extent":"固定數位原題「郗鑒」題下全文。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文及維基文庫數位轉錄；保留見證歸屬。","li